# regenerable run artifacts — never commit (recreated by run.sh)
raw/*
# EXCEPTION: the attribution extract. `raw/mutants.jsonl` is a few KB, is
# regenerable offline (`python3 iree/lane.py attribution`, no GPU), and is the
# only thing that lets `schema/gen_worklist.py::bucket()` attribute this lane's
# rows to a family from a clean checkout (the other 561 MB of raw/ stay
# ignored). `raw/*` rather than `raw/` so this negation can take effect: git
# cannot re-include a file under an excluded directory.
!raw/mutants.jsonl
